{"id":"n91767-1-8","stage":1,"title":"주로 · 主要","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n91767-1-8-1","ko":"요즘은 뭘 하면서 지내세요?","zh":"最近都在做些什么呢？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"요즘은","meaning":"最近，近来，这阵子","explanation":"요즘：最近，近来，这阵子；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"요즘","audio":"/audio/828c4030dd68aa7bc886.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20250","senseId":"1","lemma":"요즘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"뭘","meaning":"什么","explanation":"뭐：什么；ㄹ：을/를 的缩略，标记宾语，如 뭘＝무엇을。","readings":[{"term":"뭐","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"84991","senseId":"2","lemma":"뭐","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"하면서","meaning":"表示两个以上的并列或反复。","explanation":"하다：表示两个以上的并列或反复。；면서：表示同时进行或并列；与 도 合用可表示“同时却、尽管”。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"26","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"지내세요?","meaning":"度日，生活","explanation":"지내다：度日，生活；세요：包含尊敬形式的礼貌句末，可表示请求、劝告或询问等。","readings":[{"term":"지내다","audio":"/audio/d56e2e0e23cd1763208c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17173","senseId":"1","lemma":"지내다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"828c4030dd68aa7b","term":"요즘","zh":"最近，近来，这阵子","audio":"/audio/828c4030dd68aa7bc886.mp3","entryId":"20250","definition":"从非常近的过去到现在之间。","pronunciation":["요즘"]},{"id":"95b5c8cf1b249b7a","term":"뭐","zh":"什么","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3","entryId":"84991","definition":"指代不确定的对象或无需指明名字的对象。","pronunciation":["뭐ː"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"表示两个以上的并列或反复。","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"表示两个以上的并列或反复。","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"d56e2e0e23cd1763","term":"지내다","zh":"度日，生活","audio":"/audio/d56e2e0e23cd1763208c.mp3","entryId":"17173","definition":"以某种程度或状态过日子。","pronunciation":["지ː내다"]}],"audio":"/audio/199418924f3d41f0628e.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n91767-1-8-2","ko":"매일 비가 와서 주로 집 안에서 지내고 있어요.","zh":"因为每天都在下雨，所以主要待在家里。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"매일","meaning":"每日，天天","explanation":"매일：每日，天天","readings":[{"term":"매일","audio":"/audio/d5d6a44c9a8924522b29.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58103","senseId":"1","lemma":"매일","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"비가","meaning":"雨","explanation":"비：雨；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"비","audio":"/audio/5e0d62698b44a4342d26.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36681","senseId":"1","lemma":"비","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"와서","meaning":"下，来","explanation":"오다：下，来；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"오다","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69514","senseId":"17","lemma":"오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"주로","meaning":"主要","explanation":"주로：主要","readings":[{"term":"주로","audio":"/audio/082e27671571beef0683.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91767","senseId":"1","lemma":"주로","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"집","meaning":"家，屋","explanation":"집：家，屋","readings":[{"term":"집","audio":"/audio/99cf116bb12cf1061e0b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71358","senseId":"2","lemma":"집","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"안에서","meaning":"里，里面","explanation":"안：里，里面；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74890","senseId":"1","lemma":"안","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"지내고","meaning":"度日，生活","explanation":"지내다：度日，生活；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"지내다","audio":"/audio/d56e2e0e23cd1763208c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17173","senseId":"1","lemma":"지내다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"있어요.","meaning":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","explanation":"있다：正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62595","senseId":"2","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"d5d6a44c9a892452","term":"매일","zh":"每日，天天","audio":"/audio/d5d6a44c9a8924522b29.mp3","entryId":"58103","definition":"一天一天的每一天。","pronunciation":["매ː일"]},{"id":"5e0d62698b44a434","term":"비","zh":"雨","audio":"/audio/5e0d62698b44a4342d26.mp3","entryId":"36681","definition":"高空中形成云朵的水蒸气冷却凝聚后降落而下的水滴。","pronunciation":["비"]},{"id":"6fe577b99594f4a7","term":"오다","zh":"下，来","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3","entryId":"69514","definition":"降雨雪或寒潮来临。","pronunciation":["오다"]},{"id":"082e27671571beef","term":"주로","zh":"主要","audio":"/audio/082e27671571beef0683.mp3","entryId":"91767","definition":"成为基本或重心地。","pronunciation":["주로"]},{"id":"99cf116bb12cf106","term":"집","zh":"家，屋","audio":"/audio/99cf116bb12cf1061e0b.mp3","entryId":"71358","definition":"数人或动物为了生活而盖的建筑物的单位。","pronunciation":["집"]},{"id":"bc00bc8172c83d5f","term":"안","zh":"里，里面","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3","entryId":"74890","definition":"从某物体或空间的周围向着中间的方向；或指那样的部分。","pronunciation":["안"]},{"id":"d56e2e0e23cd1763","term":"지내다","zh":"度日，生活","audio":"/audio/d56e2e0e23cd1763208c.mp3","entryId":"17173","definition":"以某种程度或状态过日子。","pronunciation":["지ː내다"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"62595","definition":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","pronunciation":["읻따"]}],"audio":"/audio/f4fc13236d3f3de571b8.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.22,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=91767","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"초급","day":36,"sequenceScore":1.5602,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["因为每天都在下雨，所以主要待在家里。","最近都在做些什么呢？","您是哪里不舒服才来的呢？"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["最近都在做些什么呢？","您是哪里不舒服才来的呢？","因为每天都在下雨，所以主要待在家里。"],"answer":2}]}
